```js
console.log(1);
setTimeout(() => console.log(2));
Promise.resolve().then(() => console.log(3));
console.log(4);
// 1 4 3 2
```

1. Run the call stack (sync code).
2. Drain the **microtask** queue completely (promises, `await` continuations).
3. Take **one macrotask** (timers, I/O, events), then microtasks again, then render.

Starving the loop with endless microtasks blocks rendering.

